The '''Spider Catalyst''' is a {{Rare}} Crafting Material that is an {{O|e}} drop from {{SlayerTier|II}}+ [[Tarantula Broodfather]]s when at [[Spider Slayer]] II. It is used to make the [[Tarantula Boots]] and the [[Recluse Fang]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Tarantula Broodfather ===
The '''Spider Catalyst''' can be rarely dropped from {{Stier|2}} or above [[Tarantula Broodfather]]s if the player has reached {{Coll|Spider Slayer LVL II}}.

;Drop Chances
* {{Stier|2}}: {{Green|1.05%}}
* {{Stier|3}}: {{Green|2.06%}}
* {{Stier|4}}: {{Green|0.62%}}
* {{Stier|5}}: {{Green|0.18%}}

